{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067310/extras/fadb562a0a9c7bf971d340a450e8adf4.avif?t=1676827574\" width=616 height=77 /></span><br><br><i>Gravitas</i> is a short first-person puzzle platforming game that transports you to the Gallery of Refined Gravity (otherwise known as the GORG). There you\u2019ll meet the gallery\u2019s eccentric Curator as he accompanies you through its puzzling and increasingly lethal exhibits. Manipulate gravity and the gallery itself to prove yourself a pupil worthy of the Curator\u2019s masterwork.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067310/extras/6ed730d872210123a0d7333eb33f39dc.avif?t=1676827574\" width=616 height=77 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Bend gravity to navigate the Curator's curious exhibitions.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067310/extras/426b5dfbc1a9ea4c312df7b5a7162d49.poster.avif?t=1676827574\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067310/extras/426b5dfbc1a9ea4c312df7b5a7162d49.webm?t=1676827574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067310/extras/426b5dfbc1a9ea4c312df7b5a7162d49.mp4?t=1676827574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore the gallery with the *genius* Curator as your guide.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067310/extras/f7295f96b81429519f997953344dec30.poster.avif?t=1676827574\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com